&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; administrative support:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide high-level administrative, operational, and executive support directly to C-suite leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calendar &amp;amp; travel logistics:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee complex, fast-changing calendar schedules, expense reporting, and international travel arrangements with high precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; meeting coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a primary liaison between leadership and stakeholders while organising cross-departmental meetings and all-hands sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive communications:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in preparing and reviewing executive presentations, strategic documents, and internal communications.&lt;/li&gt;
