&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Management: &lt;/strong&gt;you navigate complex regulatory environments surrounding digital assets and regulated financial services. You understand how to balance aggressive business growth with strict risk and compliance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
