&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Manager, Growth Analytics at Bitpanda, you will build the core decision engine for our redesigned Growth organization. Your mandate is to establish trusted measurement, define clear customer economics, and deliver the high-impact analysis that dictates where the company invests. With direct access to decision-makers, you will build an analytics capability that materially shapes our customer acquisition, retention, and commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the Growth measurement strategy and operating model, establishing trusted, company-wide definitions for CAC, payback, LTV, cohort performance, and incrementality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead forecasting, performance reviews, and decision-grade analysis to drive faster, more reliable, and economically grounded capital-allocation choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and mentor a high-performing team of analytics engineers and senior analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Finance, Data, Product, and channel leaders to establish source-of-truth reporting and automate critical data workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate the quality of our experimentation and make insights widely accessible across the organization without compromising on strict analytical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
