&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of building or leading an analytics capability that goes beyond basic reporting to actively change commercial and product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are technically credible in SQL, data modeling, experimentation, and measurement, with the confidence and expertise to challenge weak analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a deep understanding of acquisition economics, cohorts, incrementality, and forecasting to set the gold standard for the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at creating clarity from fragmented data, prioritizing the few specific models and metrics that materially improve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong cross-functional leader capable of guiding analysts while fostering tight partnerships with Data, Finance, Product, and channel owners.&lt;/li&gt;
