&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Product Manager for Securities &amp;amp; Commodities, you will own key feature execution and user flows for selected traditional financial products. You will collaborate closely with Engineering, Design, and Business Operations to turn complex financial workflows into simple, transparent retail trading experiences. This is a high-impact opportunity for an execution-focused PM eager to build leading multi-asset investing experiences across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take direct ownership of specific product flows within securities and commodities, such as equity trading interfaces, margin trading touchpoints, or RWA execution steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, detailed product specifications, process flows, and user stories, serving as the primary day-to-day product contact for Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with UX, Design, and Data teams to turn complex financial concepts into transparent, high-converting retail experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain fast shipping velocity and high task completion by actively collaborating with Engineering, Business Operations, and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track feature adoption and performance metrics to identify UX friction points and drive continuous optimizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2–4 years&lt;/strong&gt; of Product Management experience building trading, retail brokerage, or fintech products (ideally within a MiFID II or regulated environment).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good functional understanding of capital markets, order execution flows, clearing, and basic retail investing mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid data-driven, analytical mindset with practical experience using product analytics to guide feature iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong structured communication skills to translate business and technical requirements into actionable product specs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with multi-asset investing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
