&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Advanced Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a subject matter expert to analyze complex business requirements from cross-functional stakeholders, translating them into scalable, robust technical solutions from needs analysis to delivery and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower Data-Driven Decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Design advanced Jira reports, high-level dashboards, and customized planning views for leadership and various business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate &amp;amp; Integrate:&lt;/strong&gt; Build advanced automations and integrations with other enterprise tools using 3rd party apps and REST APIs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct specialised training for employees, advocate for Atlassian best practices across the company, and mentor junior team members to elevate the team&#39;s overall technical capability.&lt;/li&gt;
