&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Creative Copywriter (German)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our cross-functional team of designers, 3D artists, and AI-savvy art directors. In this role, you will define the voice of Bitpanda across our different markets and translate complex financial concepts into bold, clear, and high-converting creative concepts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are an agency-seasoned wordsmith looking to trade client decks for true brand ownership, cutting-edge AI tools, and high-visibility campaigns, this is your next step.&lt;/p&gt;
