&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;360° Campaign Ideation:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner directly with Art Directors, 3D Artists, and Designers to conceptualize integrated campaigns: from high-level campaign hooks and video scripts to OOH, landing pages, and performance ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate Complexity into Simplicity:&lt;/strong&gt; Demystify crypto, stocks, ETFs, and digital assets into engaging, accessible, and compliant copy without losing the creative edge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Consistency &amp;amp; Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain Bitpanda’s German tone-of-voice guidelines across external campaigns and internal communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
