&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ Years of Creative Agency or Brand Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record at a top advertising/creative agency or a high-growth tech/fintech brand, managing multi-channel campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;360° Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; A portfolio showcasing conceptual campaign work, short-form copy (OOH, social, performance ads), long-form narrative (video scripts, editorial), and clear brand messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
