&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Trading Operations Specialist at Bitpanda, your mission is to ensure a secure and smooth trading experience. You are well-versed in the foundations of financial instruments and trading systems and also possess a very strong, problem-solving-oriented mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep-dive into and quick understanding of our financial products, trading and hedging systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle market alerts and execute OTC trades &amp;amp; blockchain transactions on behalf of Bitpanda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform daily settlement and reconciliation of trades&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor hedging and trading activity and maintain the relevant risk parameter settings; you will be the first line of defence for the sanity of our trading and hedging operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively document and improve processes &amp;amp; recommend system developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in trading operations or a similar area (trader certificate is a plus); you should have a great understanding of and/or interest in financial markets, particularly equities or cryptocurrencies/blockchain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify problems and solve them quickly or escalate them as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data investigation skills (MS Excel in particular and SQL or working with databases is a plus; experience with Bloomberg, Refinitiv (Reuters) or FactSet is welcome)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great team player with strong attention to detail, excellent organizational and communication skills (English is a must), thriving in an ever-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in night shift (00:00-07:00) to ensure operational continuity in a 24/7 business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
